</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Revive Thy work, dear Lord!</l><l>Disturb this sleep of death;</l><l>Quicken the smouldering embers now</l><l>By Thine almighty breath.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Revive Thy work, dear Lord!</l><l>Create soul-thirst for Thee;</l><l>And hungering for the Bread of Life,</l><l>O may our spirits be!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Revive Thy work, dear Lord!</l><l>And give abounding joy;</l><l>O fill our hearts with perfect love,</l><l>And burn out all alloy!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Revive Thy work, dear Lord!</l><l>Repeat Thy deeds of grace;</l><l>Thy mighty name be magnified,</l><l>To Thee be all the praise.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
